#. 'RASO Sync Settings'
#: raso_sync/raso_sync/doctype/raso_sync_settings/raso_sync_settings.json
msgid "Cron job interval to check for data to send to RASO. If set to 0, then automatic sending is turned off. If it more than 60 minutes, it will be rounded down to hourly intervals."
